    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the sadness is everywhere kaelen. it's like no matter what i do, the world just feels heavier. it's not just the kingdom, it's like... eventually everything ends anyway. why do we even bother struggling through all this pain just to reach the same end? i just want the noise in my head to stop.",
